{"id":120922552721050,"name":"Diving Legends","desc":"🌊 Welcome to Diving Legends! 🌊\n\nDive deeper, earn more, and become a true legend of the ocean! In Diving Legends, every meter you descend you earn money and bigger rewards. The deeper you go, the more money you earn!\n\n\n❓ How To Play:\n💰 Dive deeper in the depths and collect more money.\n⚡ Train Your Speed, Swim faster and reach deeper zones quicker.\n🤿 Increase Your Oxygen, Stay underwater longer.\n🔧 Upgrade Your Gear, Improve your equipment to survive extreme depths.\n🏆 Become a Legend, Compete to be the best diver on the leaderboard!\n\n\nStart with basic gear and work your way down into the mysterious deep sea. Can you handle the pressure and reach the deepest point?\n\nDive in now and become a true Diving Legend! 👑","path":"/game/120922552721050-diving-legends","slug":"120922552721050-diving-legends","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/391f782c6502a90833f39787723424af621412b30b9c244faf8eb3adaf6a3a50.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-927cd3e89146ef6be8a7386baf8bf29a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":134,"visitor":31227763,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-02T16:47:15.731Z","creator":{"name":"Wasser Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"69ce9d933a3a2289abcd1f6e","title":"auto farm coin","game":{"_id":"69c040975fe42ed96af525be","gameId":120922552721050,"name":"Diving Legends","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/391f782c6502a90833f39787723424af621412b30b9c244faf8eb3adaf6a3a50.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-927cd3e89146ef6be8a7386baf8bf29a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"120922552721050-diving-legends","path":"/game/120922552721050-diving-legends","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/391f782c6502a90833f39787723424af621412b30b9c244faf8eb3adaf6a3a50.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-927cd3e89146ef6be8a7386baf8bf29a/150